{"evidence":["`cargo test -p tank_core --test plant_algae_integration algae_` passed: 7/7 algae-focused tests green.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test save_load save_load_roundtrip` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test save_load migration_chain_applies_v2_to_current` passed.","Reproduced a legacy save-compatibility regression with an isolated Rust load: a schema-7 save that uses `algae_half_saturation_n_mg_total = 5.0` and `algae_half_saturation_p_mg_total = 0.8` deserializes to `n=5` and `p=0.8`, showing there is no value migration from legacy total-based semantics to the new concentration semantics.","Reproduced the same regression for preset TOML loading: `ProcessParamsPreset` parsed from legacy keys `algae_half_saturation_*_mg_total` also yields `n=5` and `p=0.8` unchanged.","`git show --stat --summary 24a3360` shows the advertised `tanksim-6e5.2.5` checkpoint only changed `crates/tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs` and `crates/tank_core/src/types/water.rs`; it did not contain the algae refactor described in the prior-stage summary."],"findings_or_gaps":["High: backward compatibility is broken for persisted/configured algae half-saturation values. `crates/tank_core/src/types/process.rs:154` and `crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs:850` keep the old field names as serde aliases, but `crates/tank_core/src/save.rs:16` has no schema bump/migration and `crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs:1192` no longer applies the legacy normalization for these fields. Any save, API payload, or custom preset still using `algae_half_saturation_*_mg_total` will now load 5.0/0.8 as literal mg/L instead of the intended 0.25/0.04 mg/L-equivalent values, materially changing algae behavior.","Medium: the prior-stage artifact is not auditable as written. The reported `plan_and_implement` checkpoint `24a3360` does not contain the algae/test changes it claims, so the implementation summary and the recorded checkpoint diverge."],"follow_up_or_amendments":["Add an explicit save-schema migration for the algae half-saturation rename/semantic change: bump schema version, detect legacy `algae_half_saturation_*_mg_total` payloads, and convert their values into concentration units before deserializing `TankState`.","Restore backward-compatible preset loading for legacy TOML keys, either by reintroducing the old normalization path for the alias names or by adding a dedicated legacy-field conversion step before `ProcessParamsPreset` validation/materialization.","Add regression tests that load a legacy save and a legacy process preset using `algae_half_saturation_n_mg_total = 5.0` / `algae_half_saturation_p_mg_total = 0.8` and assert the runtime values become `0.25` / `0.04`.","Regenerate or correct the stage checkpoint/summary so the recorded `tanksim-6e5.2.5` artifact actually points at the implementation being reviewed."],"outcome":"request_changes"}